              highlighted: ["MO","ABCDh"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "side of a rational plus a medial area", ref: "X.40" }] },
            { text: "Therefore, if an area is contained by a rational straight line and the fifth binomial,",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["ABCDh","AB","AD"] },
            { text: "then the side of the area is the irrational straight line called the side of a rational plus a medial area.",
